1
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:33,240
Tôi đến đón anh, trời vừa chớm xuân,
I came to bring you home, just as spring began.

2
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:40,240
Họ bảo anh đi... đã nửa năm rồi.
They told me you'd been gone... for half a year.

3
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:47,480
Tôi đem bao năm chắt chiu đi gõ cửa,
I knocked on every door with all I'd saved through the years.

4
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:54,420
Chỉ mong ngày anh về... gần thêm chút thôi.
Hoping to bring the day you'd come home... a little closer.

5
00:00:55,420 --> 00:01:01,760
Tôi vẫn lên lớp, vẫn giảng chuyện sum vầy,
I still taught my classes, still spoke of reunions.

6
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:08,440
Mà chữ “về”... nghẹn giữa trang thơ.
Yet the word "home"... caught in my throat between the lines of poetry.

7
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:13,340
夢裡的雪，落滿你肩頭，
In my dreams, snow falls upon your shoulders.

8
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:16,860
我抱緊你，不敢再鬆手。
I hold you so tightly, afraid to let go again.

9
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:20,380
醒來懷裡，只有一場空，
But when I wake, my arms embrace nothing but emptiness.

10
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:23,940
喚你千遍，回答我的只有風。
I call your name a thousand times, but only the wind replies.

11
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:27,920
Người khuyên tôi quên, tìm người thay thế,
They told me to forget you, to find someone new.

12
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:31,860
Tôi chỉ cười... nhà đã có anh rồi.
I only smiled... because my home already had you.

13
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:35,220
Nếu xa nhau là cách anh che chở,
If leaving me was your way of protecting me,

14
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:39,240
Sao chẳng hỏi tôi... có muốn vậy đâu?
Why didn't you ask... if that was what I wanted?

15
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:44,620
Tôi trách anh bỏ dở câu chuyện cũ,
I blamed you for leaving our story unfinished.

16
00:01:45,980 --> 00:01:52,320
Mà đời mình... chẳng viết nổi chữ quên.
Yet in the story of my life... I could never write the word "forget."

17
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:27,780
Trên bàn cũ, nét chữ xưa mờ bụi,
On the old table, your handwriting lay faded beneath the dust.

18
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:33,980
Một vệt sáng... khiến mắt tôi nhòa đi.
A single ray of light... blurred my eyes with tears.

19
00:02:34,860 --> 00:02:42,120
Rời mái trường xưa, tôi về căn nhà ấy,
I left the school behind and returned to that old house.

20
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:48,600
Cửa vẫn phủ bụi... sợ anh lại quay lưng.
I left the dust upon the door... afraid you'd turn away again.

21
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:53,800
桌上的灰，埋了五年等候，
The dust upon the table buried five years of waiting.

22
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:57,240
那一點光，讓我忍不住淚流。
That little glimmer of light brought tears I couldn't hold back.

23
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,460
門上的灰，我捨不得拂走，
I couldn't bring myself to wipe the dust from the door.

24
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:04,240
怕你看見有人，又轉身遠走。
Afraid you'd see someone was home... and turn away once more.

25
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:07,860
我等了五年，不是為了告別，
I waited five years, not just to say goodbye.

26
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:11,800
你以為離開，是給我的成全。
You thought leaving me would set me free.

27
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:15,200
可沒有你，春天也像冬天，
But without you, even spring feels like winter.

28
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:18,460
若你回頭，我就在這裡。
If you ever turn back, I'll be right here.

29
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:22,140
別再一個人，承受所有風雪，
Don't face all the storms and snow alone anymore.

30
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:25,880
餘生的路，讓我陪你走完。
Let me walk beside you for the rest of our lives.

31
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:28,420
人生難得一知己，
In a lifetime, a true soulmate is so hard to find.

32
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:31,600
王劉終得相守。
At last, Wang and Liu are together, never to part.

33
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:38,620
此生有你，別無所求，
With you in my life, there's nothing more I could ask for.

34
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:47,120
月下雙喜，有誰共鳴？
Double happiness beneath the moon... who can feel the love we share?

35
00:03:47,580 --> 00:03:51,560
Ngày anh mở cửa, tôi ngỡ mình còn mơ,
The day you opened the door, I thought I was still dreaming.

36
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:55,420
Năm năm xa cách... hóa đôi lời khách sáo.
Five years apart... reduced to a few awkward, polite words.

37
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:58,800
Đêm anh say, tôi vừa lau vừa trách,
That night, as you lay drunk, I wiped your face and gently scolded you.

38
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:04,180
Ôm thật khẽ... sợ mai anh lại đi.
I held you so gently... afraid you'd leave again tomorrow.

39
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:08,940
不是夢啊，這次不是夢，
It's not a dream... this time, it's really not a dream.

40
00:04:08,940 --> 00:04:12,460
我抱著你，怕天亮又成空。
I hold you close, afraid you'll vanish when morning comes.

41
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:15,900
你說這個家，始終也有我，
You told me there had always been a place for me in this home.

42
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:19,720
五年的委屈，終於哭在你懷中。
At last, five years of buried sorrow poured out in your arms.

43
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:23,360
我等了五年，不是為了告別，
I waited five years, not just to say goodbye.

44
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:26,920
你以為離開，是給我的成全。
You thought leaving me would set me free.

45
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:30,680
可沒有你，春天也像冬天，
But without you, even spring feels like winter.

46
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:34,040
若你回頭，我就在這裡。
If you ever turn back, I'll be right here.

47
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:37,680
別再一個人，承受所有風雪，
Don't face all the storms and snow alone anymore.

48
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:41,360
餘生的路，讓我陪你走完。
Let me walk beside you for the rest of our lives.

49
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:43,780
人生難得一知己，
In a lifetime, a true soulmate is so hard to find.

50
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:47,260
王劉終得相守。
At last, Wang and Liu are together, never to part.

51
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:54,360
此生有你，別無所求，
With you in my life, there's nothing more I could ask for.

52
00:04:56,140 --> 00:05:04,880
月下雙喜，有誰共鳴？
Double happiness beneath the moon... who can feel the love we share?

53
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:10,300
Tôi không đòi năm năm quay trở lại,
I don't ask for those five lost years to return.

54
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:14,500
Chỉ mong anh... đừng tự chọn chia xa.
I only ask... that you never choose to leave me again.

55
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:20,940
Chiều tan lớp, anh đứng bên ngưỡng cửa,
When my classes end, there you are, waiting by the door.

56
00:05:21,980 --> 00:05:29,480
Hai mái đầu bạc... cùng trở về nhà.
Two heads turned gray with time... coming home together.
